- **Drag a widget** onto the board and it goes where you drop it:
  - beside a widget, on whichever side of it you let go;
  - at the end of a row, if you drop on the row's empty space;
  - into a new row under a full row (four widgets);
  - into a new row at the end, if you drop on the dashed zone.

