The board's drag-and-drop lives inside the page, and the shell's panels sit beside the page, outside it. So the board renders this panel itself and portals it into a slot the shell keeps right after the page (`ShellState.screenPanelHost`). The panel is still opened through `setPanel({ type: 'add-widget', reportId })`, so it closes when another panel opens or you leave the page, like every other panel.

